        <h1 class="font-serif font-black text-white text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Mihintale</h1>
        <p class="text-white/80 mt-2 text-lg">Cultural Triangle • Buddhism's Arrival • Ancient Ruins • Sacred Mountain</p>
